# E

This niladic function returns a reference pointing to `→[*.Enumerations|InputDataTypes]` which is an enumration 
with all the data types available in `Input`.

There is a method `∆List` available that can be used to list the contents:

~~~
      Input.E.∆List
 Button        1
 Character     2
 Currency      4
 Date          5
 DropDown      6
 DropEdit      7
 Image        13
 Label         9
 ListView     10
 Notepad      11
 Numeric      12
 Password     20
 PlaceHolder  14
 Radio        15
 Spinner      16
 Tab          17
 Time         18
 YesNo        19
~~~
